+3.  **Feature Function $F$:** A 4-layer MLP with a hidden dimension of 256, identical in architecture to $c$ [S1]. The feature function $F$ is instantiated in parallel to the radiance function $c$, and its outputs are volume-rendered to produce $\Psi(o, v)$ [S1].
